# REC with BARS set: the part being recorded goes round, also in SONG mode (the demo plays the road: before, the take ran on
# into the next blocks - "the music flies away"); the punch-out gives the road back
wait 300
expect part 0
tap SEL
wait 100
setbars 0 4
wait 50
expect barsA 4
tap REC
wait 3500
key w2 down 90
wait 400
key w2 up
# 4 bars at 76 BPM: 12.6 s; well past it, still part A, the loop round
wait 16000
expect part 0
expect ptick <1536
key w4 down 90
wait 400
key w4 up
wait 14000
expect part 0
tap REC
wait 200
# the take over: still part A round (not off along the road), till the stop
wait 15000
expect part 0
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
